        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Aharon Barak\n- Organizations: Kahan Commission\n- Roles: Supreme Court Judge, Professor of Law, lecturer in law, Major general (res.)\n- Places: Herzliya, Jerusalem\n- Institutions: Interdisciplinary Center, Hebrew University of Jerusalem, Yale Law School, Central European University, Georgetown University Law Center, University of Toronto Faculty of Law\n\nFacts:\n- Aharon Barak was one of the other two members of the Kahan Commission, and he served as a Supreme Court Judge.\n- Another of the other two members of the Kahan Commission was a Major general (res.).\n- Aharon Barak was born as Aharon Brick on 16 September 1936.\n- Aharon Barak is a Professor of Law at the Interdisciplinary Center in Herzliya.\n- Aharon Barak is a lecturer in law at the Hebrew University of Jerusalem, Yale Law School, Central European University, Georgetown University Law Center, and the University of Toronto Faculty of Law.",
